{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_019LuZ6pxQpgKmvg1s4m5RTA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```\n2.4 Target Code Read\n- Current code does: SponsorsView displays a list of sponsors with logo, name, tier badge, URL, and reorder/delete buttons. It has an \"Add Sponsor\" form at the bottom.\n- Change needed: Add \"Adjust\" expand/collapse button to each sponsor row that reveals an adjustment panel with:\n  - 320x180 live preview iframe pointing to sponsors-cycle.html\n  - Crop controls (X, Y, W, H)\n  - Scale control (10-300%)\n  - Offset controls (X, Y: -500 to +500)\n  - Reset button\n  - Auto-save on change via saveSponsor()\n- Lines affected: 768-839 (sponsor row mapping)\n```\n\nNow I'll implement the changes. I need to:\n1. Add `AdjustmentsIcon` (or Cog6ToothIcon) import for the Adjust button\n2. Add state to track which sponsor is expanded for adjustment\n3. Modify each sponsor row to include an \"Adjust\" button\n4. Add the adjustment panel that appears when expanded"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":296,"cache_read_input_tokens":44806,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":296,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"623d268e-3d0e-4701-98d6-e5c259b68bd7","uuid":"b7eb6abb-49d3-4ada-9270-3ed3765d8f6e"}
